# **Executive Summary**

The Whole Truth Foods (TWT) has built one of the most distinctive brand experiences in India's D2C food space  the site does an excellent job of translating the brand's "clean label, nothing to hide" positioning into visual and copy choices.
The homepage is confident, editorial, and trust-forward. However, as a PM I'd flag that the site optimizes heavily for brand storytelling at
the top of the funnel while leaving real friction in the conversion-critical middle of the funnel as fragmented customizer UX, ungamified cart
drawers, and missing subscription loops cause notable revenue leakage. While I find through my benchmarking peers like Cosmix and Open Secret
outperform TWT in session personalization and cart gamification, executing a targeted 90-day RICE roadmap focused on dynamic cart progress 
indicators, unified customizer architecture, and automated recurring orders is projected to deliver a lift in Average Order Value (AOV),
in customizer completion, and an **expansion in 90-day Customer Lifetime Value (LTV).

